+// Boot-service setup and remote update may build separate stagers; the whole
+// transaction is serialized across every instance in this process. Across
+// processes there is no lock file: each attempt works in its own private
+// staging directory and the publishing rename is the only serialization point,
+// so a killed process leaves nothing that can block a later attempt.
+const stagingLock = Semaphore.makeUnsafe(1);
